@{
    ViewBag.Title = "Main Page";
}

<h1>Welcome to the MVC Tools App</h1>

<p>How to use:</p>

<h2>Quadratic Equation</h2>
<p>Format: <code>/Tool/Solve/a/b/c</code></p>
<p>Example: <code>/Tool/Solve/2/3/4</code></p>

<h2>Guessing Game</h2>
<p>Set range: <code>/Game/Set,n</code></p>
<p>Draw a number: <code>/Game/Draw</code></p>
<p>Guess it: <code>/Game/Guess,n</code></p>